<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Gas - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Gas - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.05		vs	   18.33</p>
<p> Operating	  237    million    vs	  250    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 362    million    vs   loss 359    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 362    million    vs   loss 359    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.88 yen	  vs     loss 5.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     62 million	  vs	  60 million</p>
<p> Interim div	    --		vs		--</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokkaido Gas Co Ltd supplies gas to Sapporo, Otaru and Hakodate in Hokkaido.</p>
